nd": 504.448, "text": "You're asking me?"}, {"start": 504.448, "end": 506.448, "text": "I'm still looking for a long battle."}, {"start": 506.448, "end": 507.448, "text": "Let's play poker."}, {"start": 507.448, "end": 509.448, "text": "Oh, now we're talking."}, {"start": 509.448, "end": 510.448, "text": "Check the desk."}, {"start": 510.448, "end": 511.448, "text": "I'll check the dresser."}, {"start": 511.448, "end": 513.448, "text": "How do I straighten that painting?"}, {"start": 513.448, "end": 514.448, "text": "You can't."}, {"start": 514.448, "end": 515.448, "text": "Stop playing like a girl."}, {"start": 515.448, "end": 519.448, "text": "Stop playing like a girl?"}, {"start": 519.448, "end": 521.448, "text": "Here's the thing about women, Jeff."}, {"start": 521.448, "end": 525.448, "text": "We don't hack and slash our way through life because we're one with life."}, {"start": 525.448, "end": 526.448, "text": "Help me hide the body."}, {"start": 526.448, "end": 528.448, "text": "Oh, my Lord."}, {"start": 528.448, "end": 530.448, "text": "Surely these things happen in video games."}, {"start": 530.448, "end": 531.448, "text": "They do?"}, {"start": 531.448, "end": 532.448, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 532.448, "end": 534.448, "text": "We can't get hung up on real world morality."}, {"start": 534.448, "end": 536.448, "text": "We need to survive and win."}, {"start": 536.448, "end": 538.448, "text": "Hello, I'm the blacksmith's wife."}, {"start": 538.448, "end": 539.448, "text": "Help, help, help."}, {"start": 539.448, "end": 540.448, "text": "Oh, crap."}, {"start": 540.448, "end": 541.448, "text": "Guard the door."}, {"start": 541.448, "end": 542.448, "text": "Help, help."}, {"start": 542.448, "end": 543.448, "text": "Surely."}, {"start": 543.448, "end": 545.448, "text": "No witnesses."}, {"start": 545.448, "end": 546.448, "text": "Grab everything you can carry."}, {"start": 546.448, "end": 548.448, "text": "I'll check upstairs for any more family."}, {"start": 548.448, "end": 549.448, "text": "Don't give me that look."}, {"start": 549.448, "end": 550.448, "text": "These are your loose ends."}, {"start": 550.448, "end": 551.448, "text": "I'm just tied up."}, {"start": 551.448, "end": 553.448, "text": "This is so cool."}, {"start": 553.448, "end": 554.448, "text": "Where are your clothes?"}, {"start": 554.448, "end": 556.448, "text": "Piers taught me poker."}, {"start": 556.448, "end": 557.448, "text": "I'm not good at it."}, {"start": 557.448, "end": 558.448, "text": "You still talking to this girl?"}, {"start": 558.448, "end": 559.448, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 559.448, "end": 561.448, "text": "She only has three moods that you activate with basic patterns of stimulus."}, {"start": 561.448, "end": 562.448, "text": "I've never felt this way before."}, {"start": 562.448, "end": 564.448, "text": "Hey, but don't get weird."}, {"start": 564.448, "end": 565.448, "text": "Oh, I won't."}, {"start": 565.448, "end": 567.448, "text": "She's not ready for anything serious, but she wants me to meet her family."}, {"start": 567.448, "end": 569.448, "text": "My father is the blacksmith."}, {"start": 569.448, "end": 570.448, "text": "Her father's a blacksmith."}, {"start": 570.448, "end": 571.448, "text": "Hello."}, {"start": 571.448, "end": 572.448, "text": "Everybody go shopping?"}, {"start": 572.448, "end": 574.448, "text": "That's all we did."}, {"start": 574.448, "end": 575.448, "text": "Is that hot on fire?"}, {"start": 575.448, "end": 576.448, "text": "Oh, my."}, {"start": 576.448, "end": 579.448, "text": "What an unexplained tragedy."}, {"start": 579.448, "end": 581.448, "text": "Don't we look comfy at a cauldron?"}, {"start": 581.448, "end": 583.448, "text": "Check it out."}, {"start": 583.448, "end": 589.448, "text": "Ooh, see, I'll put all of this in here, and then that, and then I'll hit this."}, {"start": 589.448, "end": 590.448, "text": "What is it?"}, {"start": 590.448, "end": 592.448, "text": "I assume like a strength potion."}, {"start": 592.448, "end": 593.448, "text": "Then I assume it's poison."}, {"start": 593.448, "end": 596.448, "text": "You're just jealous because we found a world where I know what I'm doing."}, {"start": 596.448, "end": 600.448, "text": "This place is 20 cat turds and a pixies poster from being your apartment."}, {"start": 600.448, "end": 602.448, "text": "No, no."}, {"start": 602.448, "end": 603.6738064516129, "text": "What's with the St."}, {"start": 603.6738064516129, "end": 604.448, "text": "Paulie girl?"}, {"start": 604.448, "end": 605.448, "text": "Hilda's parents live there."}, {"start": 605.448, "end": 606.448, "text": "Now she has no family."}, {"start": 606.448, "end": 610.448, "text": "She'll be forced to marry a male villager or take her chances in the wilderness."}, {"start": 610.448, "end": 612.448, "text": "What kind of game is this?"}, {"start": 612.448, "end": 613.448, "text": "Oh, crap."}, {"start": 613.448, "end": 614.448, "text": "It's Gilbert."}, {"start": 614.448, "end": 615.448, "text": "Well, well, well."}, {"start": 615.448, "end": 617.448, "text": "Looks like someone's one step behind."}, {"start": 617.448, "end": 618.448, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 618.448, "end": 619.448, "text": "If you're looking for equipment, tough luck."}, {"start": 619.448, "end": 621.448, "text": "The store was lost in a freak accident."}, {"start": 621.448, "end": 623.448, "text": "I hardly need equipment, young lady."}, {"start": 623.448, "end": 626.448, "text": "While you were shopping, I gained enough levels to do this."}, {"start": 628.448, "end": 630.448, "text": "He's shooting lightning and I'm naked."}, {"start": 630.448, "end": 631.448, "text": "Quick, get behind us."}, {"start": 631.448, "end": 632.448, "text": "We have armor."}, {"start": 633.33, "end": 635.33, "text": "Oh"}, {"start": 636.2700000000001, "end": 640.5500000000001, "text": "Great Gilbert, oh great evil giant lightning Gilbert"}, {"start": 641.9100000000001, "end": 645.23, "text": "Britta drink that super strength potion you made"}, {"start": 649.5500000000001, "end": 654.33, "text": "I thought we could count on Britta to not screw up drinking this will be fun"}, {"start": 656.07, "end": 660.73, "text": "What the hell here's hoping we can count on her to screw up making potions"}, {"start": 663.33, "end": 665.33, "text": "Oh"}, {"start": 669.8100000000001, "end": 672.8385714285714, "text": "Unbelievable Jeff bet all our lives on Britta and one"}, {"start": 672.8385714285714, "end": 675.01, "text": "and I lost my pants to a pair of nines"}, {"start": 677.57, "end": 681.1500000000001, "text": "Very well, let's play"}, {"start": 691.377, "end": 693.237, "text": "I'll bet are you sure about this?"}, {"start": 693.237, "end": 695.8860909090909, "text": "Yeah, it just feels like the right thing to do."}, {"start": 695.8860909090909, "end": 696.9569999999999, "text": "Hey, I made it back"}, {"start": 701.222, "end": 702.3802089552239, "text": "You guys never died."}, {"start": 702.3802089552239, "end": 703.8279701492537, "text": "How did you beat Gilbert?"}, {"start": 703.8279701492537, "end": 705.102, "text": "Oh, you know teamwork?"}, {"start": 705.222, "end": 707.782, "text": "We were headed for the black caves to find the white crystal"}, {"start": 707.782, "end": 709.9607826086957, "text": "We were just saying goodbye to Abed I'm gonna stay here in"}, {"start": 709.9607826086957, "end": 712.102, "text": "the village with Hilda and help her rebuild our life Abed"}, {"start": 712.102, "end": 715.0616153846154, "text": "She's a program people left said similar things about me."}, {"start": 715.0616153846154, "end": 716.8789230769231, "text": "Oh, he's playing the rain man card."}, {"start": 716.8789230769231, "end": 717.502, "text": "Let's bounce"}, {"start": 717.502, "end": 719.502, "text": "I've got an inheritance to win"}, {"start": 725.782, "end": 727.782, "text": "Offensive called it shut up Britta"}, {"start": 731.142, "end": 733.762, "text": "You did great in there Jeff shut up Pierce"}, {"start": 738.662, "end": 740.982, "text": "Okay duck stay ducked"}, {"start": 741.542, "end": 743.182, "text": "Okay unduck"}, {"start": 743.182, "end": 744.942, "text": "Okay now jump"}, {"start": 744.942, "end": 746.5045, "text": "Think we're almost there."}, {"start": 746.5045, "end": 747.1295, "text": "Thank God."}, {"start": 747.1295, "end": 748.567, "text": "This cave is the worst."}, {"start": 748.567, "end": 748.942, "text": "I know"}, {"start": 748.942, "end": 751.7734814814814, "text": "I don't know what's more offensive the actual racism or"}, {"start": 751.7734814814814, "end": 754.502, "text": "the insulting notion that might somehow rub off on us"}, {"start": 755.0219999999999, "end": 757.0219999999999, "text": "Look out"}, {"start": 770.142, "end": 776.482, "text": "All right the white crystal I'll take it I've earned it by having friends"}, {"start": 780.3820000000001, "end": 782.3820000000001, "text": "This is it"}, {"start": 785.502, "end": 787.502, "text": "I think"}, {"start": 794.902, "end": 797.822, "text": "Where'd you get all that stuff you've only been alive for an hour"}, {"start": 803.502, "end": 806.8059999999999, "text": "Well, that was not fair what the hell Gilbert you cheated I"}, {"start": 806.8059999999999, "end": 810.502, "text": "have no problem with but you're getting caught and that's not cool"}, {"start": 810.502, "end": 813.722, "text": "Yeah, don't be a knob that inheritance is rightfully mine"}, {"start": 814.502, "end": 817.1187741935485, "text": "Rightfully, I'm his son."}, {"start": 817.1187741935485, "end": 817.8820000000001, "text": "So am I"}, {"start": 821.862, "end": 823.862, "text": "That can't be true"}, {"start": 825.062, "end": 825.813320754717, "text": "White nice."}, {"start": 825.813320754717, "end": 828.3404905660377, "text": "Do you remember your childhood nanny?"}, {"start": 828.3404905660377, "end": 828.682, "text": "Edda?"}, {"start": 829.562, "end": 831.562, "text": "What Edda had a hot cousin?"}, {"start": 832.302, "end": 834.302, "text": "my mother"}, {"start": 834.302, "end": 838.1864444444445, "text": "So you see Pierce I am your half-brother and I"}, {"start": 838.1864444444445, "end": 841.902, "text": "am more your father's son than you ever were"}, {"start": 842.342, "end": 844.342, "text": "So shut up and play the game"}, {"start": 844.502, "end": 850.0018260869565, "text": "Okay, look I know things seem hopeless because he's all the"}, {"start": 850.0018260869565, "end": 855.222, "text": "way to the castle with a crystal and we're starting over"}, {"start": 855.462, "end": 858.5219999999999, "text": "But here's the thing we're better at this game now."}, {"start": 858.5219999999999, "end": 861.462, "text": "We've died and been reborn and that makes us hero"}, {"start": 882.4559999999999, "end": 885.6036923076922, "text": "I guess the fact that we're still playing means he hasn't won yet."}, {"start": 885.6036923076922, "end": 886.8913846153845, "text": "Yeah, but what's the point?"}, {"start": 886.8913846153845, "end": 888.656, "text": "He'll just keep cheating till he wins"}, {"start": 889.256, "end": 891.256, "text": "Why are all the trees cut down?"}, {"start": 893.2959999999999, "end": 895.336, "text": "Isn't this where Ovid's village was"}, {"start": 897.0559999999999, "end": 899.736, "text": "Hello old friend Ovid you remember Hilda"}, {"start": 902.2159999999999, "end": 903.5414545454545, "text": "Did she just say your name?"}, {"start": 903.5414545454545, "end": 906.536, "text": "Yeah, if you max out a character's trust and affection levels"}, {"start": 906.536, "end": 908.536, "text": "You can gain access to a front-end scripting language watch"}, {"start": 912.656, "end": 914.516, "text": "She can make babies for me."}, {"start": 914.516, "end": 917.1337777777777, "text": "Oh and I can't I can't come on inside."}, {"start": 917.1337777777777, "end": 918.856, "text": "I built this from scratch"}, {"start": 918.856, "end": 920.0108387096774, "text": "Check out my castle."}, {"start": 920.0108387096774, "end": 920.8192258064515, "text": "Oh, it's nice."}, {"start": 920.8192258064515, "end": 922.4359999999999, "text": "I hope this isn't blood gold"}, {"start": 922.9759999999999, "end": 924.016, "text": "This is my family"}, {"start": 924.016, "end": 928.056, "text": "Baby Abbott has my eyes and her bonnet each baby is capable of executing custom code"}, {"start": 928.056, "end": 929.956, "text": "Which means you can write a code that makes one baby tell"}, {"start": 929.956, "end": 932.056, "text": "another baby what to do much like real children on a playground"}, {"start": 933.656, "end": 935.2881495327102, "text": "Let's find the tid men's heart later."}, {"start": 935.2881495327102, "end": 937.0967476635514, "text": "I'll bet how much stuff do you have here?"}, {"start": 937.0967476635514, "end": 938.376, "text": "And what can we make with it?"}, {"start": 938.376, "end": 940.376, "text": "That depends on"}, {"start": 941.816, "end": 943.816, "text": "You"}, {"start": 948.1759999999999, "end": 951.896, "text": "Welcome you are the first to make it to the throne of Hockville"}, {"start": 952.536, "end": 956.8090769230769, "text": "Let me take a look at you according to your complexion."}, {"start": 956.8090769230769, "end": 959.606, "text": "I think you might be Gilbert Lawson."}, {"start": 959.606, "end": 960.616, "text": "Is this true?"}, {"start": 961.9359999999999, "end": 962.7946666666666, "text": "Just a moment."}, {"start": 962.7946666666666, "end": 965.9839999999999, "text": "Hello Gilbert due to the nature of our relationship."}, {"start": 965.9839999999999, "end": 970.2159999999999, "text": "I'll need your electronic signature on this legally binding agreement"}, {"start": 971.2159999999999, "end": 974.1310847457627, "text": "It dictates that you will never ever besmirch the"}, {"start": 974.1310847457627, "end": 978.236, "text": "Hawthorn name with any outlandish notions regarding your genealogical"}, {"start": 978.816, "end": 981.5580689655172, "text": "Origins you are the bastard offspring of a"}, {"start": 981.5580689655172, "end": 984.496, "text": "colored seductress and an unknown weak willed"}, {"start": 984.816, "end": 987.9030967741935, "text": "Miscegenist and any assertion on your path to the contrary"}, {"start": 987.9030967741935, "end": 990.7240645161289, "text": "with the grounds for the seizure of this inheritance."}, {"start": 990.7240645161289, "end": 991.4159999999999, "text": "Do you agree?"}, {"start": 992.6959999999999, "end": 996.1059999999999, "text": "It's a simple question Gilbert."}, {"start": 996.1059999999999, "end": 997.536, "text": "Do you agree?"}, {"start": 1000.1759999999999, "end": 1002.1759999999999, "text": "Thank you"}, {"start": 1009.536, "end": 1012.4759999999999, "text": "Gilbert I'll always knew you disappoint me"}, {"start": 1015.9359999999999, "end": 1020.1769302325581, "text": "I see you've chosen teamwork a coward strategy."}, {"start": 1020.1769302325581, "end": 1023.6959999999999, "text": "I will upgrade your challenge according"}, {"start": 1030.176, "end": 1032.896, "text": "My fortune to no inferiors"}, {"start": 1037.136, "end": 1039.376, "text": "Attack what's this now?"}, {"start": 1043.136, "end": 1045.136, "text": "Hey for the choice"}, {"start": 1060.176, "end": 1062.176, "text": "I"}, {"start": 1085.136, "end": 1087.136, "text": "Suppose you're wondering player"}, {"start": 1087.7759999999998, "end": 1089.7759999999998, "text": "Why record myself?"}, {"start": 1090.176, "end": 1092.176, "text": "breathing will"}, {"start": 1092.7359999999999, "end": 1095.056, "text": "And letting you destroy me"}, {"start": 1096.576, "end": 1099.536, "text": "Because I am a man of honor"}, {"start": 1100.7359999999999, "end": 1106.176, "text": "So you've earned the pleasure of my death, but I didn't"}, {"start": 1106.9759999999999, "end": 1108.7474285714284, "text": "I'm not the one that beat you."}, {"start": 1108.7474285714284, "end": 1109.456, "text": "Yes, you are"}, {"start": 1111.856, "end": 1113.856, "text": "We're forfeiting"}, {"start": 1116.016, "end": 1117.096, "text": "Gilbert you're right."}, {"start": 1117.096, "end": 1119.4617142857142, "text": "You were more his son than me you took all his"}, {"start": 1119.4617142857142, "end": 1121.7759999999998, "text": "crap and you didn't even get to take his name"}, {"start": 1122.2559999999999, "end": 1125.5493333333334, "text": "He wants sat on me in church just so he could see better."}, {"start": 1125.5493333333334, "end": 1128.496, "text": "We've only been playing this game a couple of hours"}, {"start": 1129.456, "end": 1131.456, "text": "You've been playing it your whole life"}, {"start": 1132.336, "end": 1134.336, "text": "And now it's time for your reward brother"}, {"start": 1135.536, "end": 1137.536, "text": "So get in there and kill our dad"}, {"start": 1138.816, "end": 1140.816, "text": "Thank you pierce"}, {"start": 1141.376, "end": 1143.376, "text": "Wait a second"}, {"start": 1144.016, "end": 1145.2552156862746, "text": "Oh, whoa, I need it."}, {"start": 1145.2552156862746, "end": 1145.8748235294117, "text": "Oh pierce."}, {"start": 1145.8748235294117, "end": 1148.1673725490195, "text": "You really don't know how this works."}, {"start": 1148.1673725490195, "end": 1150.336, "text": "Do you are you always carrying out?"}, {"start": 1150.7359999999999, "end": 1152.7359999999999, "text": "Not in the shower"}, {"start": 1163.536, "end": 1168.0406808510638, "text": "I'd like to thank you again for today and offering my apologies for my conduct."}, {"start": 1168.0406808510638, "end": 1168.896, "text": "I wasn't myself"}, {"start": 1169.2959999999998, "end": 1172.4684137931035, "text": "Family can make a person do a lot of crazy things."}, {"start": 1172.4684137931035, "end": 1172.976, "text": "I'm stan"}, {"start": 1173.536, "end": 1175.536, "text": "I have an uncle who makes his own pizza"}, {"start": 1175.536, "end": 1179.056, "text": "Don't worry about it if it would make it up to any of you in any way"}, {"start": 1179.136, "end": 1181.456, "text": "There's a bar in town called skepers and I hear"}, {"start": 1181.456, "end": 1183.7759999999998, "text": "they make a specialty drink a margarita in fact"}, {"start": 1183.936, "end": 1188.656, "text": "And it's served in the glass an entire yard long my treat"}, {"start": 1189.696, "end": 1191.616, "text": "This is the greatest day of my life."}, {"start": 1191.616, "end": 1193.536, "text": "I've always wanted to have a brother"}, {"start": 1195.2959999999998, "end": 1198.7582222222222, "text": "Hey, hey shuttle about the word mulattos."}, {"start": 1198.7582222222222, "end": 1199.856, "text": "Is it okay or"}, {"start": 1200.7359999999999, "end": 1202.395661016949, "text": "Borderline we apologize for him."}, {"start": 1202.395661016949, "end": 1203.2254915254234, "text": "Oh, that's okay."}, {"start": 1203.2254915254234, "end": 1203.7959999999998, "text": "He's family"}, {"start": 1215.136, "end": 1217.2959999999998, "text": "Hold on my love I said i'd come back for you"}, {"start": 1224.7040000000002, "end": 1225.5161904761906, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 1225.5161904761906, "end": 1229.8270476190476, "text": "I just think that in a parallel universe blorgans are hold on a baby."}, {"start": 1229.8270476190476, "end": 1231.2640000000001, "text": "I wasn't expecting this"}, {"start": 1232.784, "end": 1233.2142222222224, "text": "Guess what?"}, {"start": 1233.2142222222224, "end": 1234.0355555555557, "text": "I have to support it."}, {"start": 1234.0355555555557, "end": 1236.304, "text": "I guess I can get some kind of job maybe at beans and more"}, {"start": 1236.384, "end": 1238.864, "text": "I'll probably have to work double shifts, but oh I see"}, {"start": 1240.144, "end": 1241.6602264150943, "text": "While you're off climbing the ladder at beans and"}, {"start": 1241.6602264150943, "end": 1243.0836226415092, "text": "more i'll just stay home and raise them alone."}, {"start": 1243.0836226415092, "end": 1243.424, "text": "That's fine"}, {"start": 1243.424, "end": 1245.174588235294, "text": "I'll just give up on my dreams."}, {"start": 1245.174588235294, "end": 1245.7957647058824, "text": "Here we go."}, {"start": 1245.7957647058824, "end": 1248.2240000000002, "text": "What he needs to learn a strong man can cry"}, {"start": 1252.116, "end": 1253.9022, "text": "So what were you saying about blorgans?"}, {"start": 1253.9022, "end": 1256.696, "text": "Blorgans in this other universe are actually called glorabans"}]}